kb/.index/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE ON kb/
#
# kb/ IS tracked on purpose: it is your knowledge base, and its history is the
# useful part — you can see what an answer used to say and get it back.
#
# It also contains personal data: your name, email, phone, employment history,
# every answer you have given, and your resume PDF. That is fine in a local or
# private repository. Do not push it to a public one.
#
# To keep the code in git but not the data, uncomment:
# kb/
